<title>USA: Paravant Computer gets $9.8 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Paravant Computer gets $9.8 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE, Fla. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paravant Computer Systems Inc said Friday that it has been awarded a contract by Raytheon Co worth $9.8 million over the next two years.</p>
<p>The contract to provide Enhanced Remote Terminal Units used as part of an air defense command and control system which Raytheon supplies to the U.S., has an option for Raytheon to purchase up to an additional $5.1 million of the units in 1998, Paravant said.</p>
</text>
